# CODEOWNERS — auto-routes PR review to the lane owner and encodes the TEAM.md split.
# Pairs with branch protection on `main` (require PR + >=1 review). Order matters:
# the LAST matching pattern wins, so specific lanes are listed after the default.
#
# Ownership mirrors docs/TEAM.md. Adjust here whenever lanes move.
#
# Rewritten 2026-09-02, when Cameron's tenure ended (last day 2026-08-31). Every
# pattern here previously named @CameronGordonn, which meant each PR after his
# departure would have requested review from someone who had left, and GitHub gives
# no warning when that happens: the review is simply never delivered. The split is
# the one the hand-off implies rather than a new plan — the engineering lanes follow
# the person who is still building (@akshitha-nagaraj), and direction plus the
# canonical status doc follow the person who sets it (@craig11f).
